        *   B in P[2][2] {NT16, NT9}
        *   NT4 NT16 -> NT14, NT16 (Rules: `NT14 -> NT4 NT16`, `NT16 -> NT4 NT16`)
    *   Split 2: (w1w2)(w3)
        *   A in P[1][2] {} (Empty set, so no results from this split)
